ent" class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top" draggable="false"/></span><div class="mt-2 flex flex-col items-center transition-opacity duration-300" style="opacity:0" aria-hidden="true"><span class="text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.005em]" style="color:#c2410c">Data Scientist</span><span class="text-[9px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-600">AI Agent</span></div></button></div><style>
        /*
         * Two-animation pipeline per card:
         *   cf-agent-rise   one-shot entrance (fade + lift)
         *   cf-agent-float  continuous bobbing
         * animation-delay carries TWO values — the first delays the rise so
         * cards stagger in left → right, the second delays the float so the
         * idle bobbing isn't synchronized across the row.
         */
        .cf-agent {
          animation:
            cf-agent-rise 720ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1) both,
            cf-agent-float 5.4s ease-in-out infinite;
          animation-delay: 0ms, 0ms;
          will-change: transform, opacity;
        }
        .cf-agent:hover .cf-agent-frame {
          transform: translateY(-4px);
        }
        @keyframes cf-agent-rise {
          0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.94); }
          60%  { opacity: 1; }
          100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
        }
        @keyframes cf-agent-float {
          0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
          50%      { transform: translateY(-6px); }
        }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
          .cf-agent {
            animation: none !important;
          }
        }
      </style></div></section></main><footer class="relative z-10 mt-20 bg-black text-[#c7cdd1]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1240px] px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 sm:py-20"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-7 md:col-span-1"><div class="flex h-6 items-center"><img src="/logos/coframe-logo-dark.svg" alt="Coframe" class="h-6 w-auto"/></div><p class="max-w-[24ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.5] text-[#8a8f93]">Optimize and personalize your digital experiences, at scale.</p><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="font-bold leading-none tabular-nums text-white text-[28px] tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-[32px]">39%</span><div class="flex flex-col leading-tight "><span class="font-semibold text-[#d7e6de] text-[12px] tracking-tight sm:text-[13px]">of Coframe tests win</span><span class="text-[#6e857c] text-[11px] sm:text-[12px]">industry avg<!-- --> <span>12%</span></span></div></div><ul class="flex items-center gap-6 text-white"><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/96919344/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center text-white/70 transition-colors hover:text-white"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.98 3.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 0 5.001 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5zM3 9h4v12H3zM10 9h3.8v1.7h.05c.53-1 1.83-2.05 3.77-2.05 4.03 0 4.78 2.65 4.78 6.1V21h-4v-5.55c0-1.32-.02-3.02-1.84-3.02-1.85 0-2.13 1.44-2.13 2.93V21H10z"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href="https://x.com/coframe_ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="X" class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center text-white/70 transition-colors hover:text-white"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.53 3H21l-7.19 8.22L22 21h-6.56l-5.14-6.72L4.4 21H1l7.74-8.84L1 3h6.72l4.65 6.15L17.53 3zm-1.15 16h1.86L7.72 5H5.75l10.63 14z"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href="https://gith